# A survey fixed-wing, as opposed to ArduPilot's bare SITL plane: the same camera
# trigger, servo gimbal and SD mission storage as survey_copter.parm, so a mission's
# camera and gimbal items have something real to act on (CAMERA_FEEDBACK is the
# evidence). Servos 9 and 10 are free on the SITL plane, whose surfaces use 1-4.
CAM1_TYPE 1
SERVO9_FUNCTION 10
MNT1_TYPE 1
SERVO10_FUNCTION 7
MNT1_PITCH_MIN -90
MNT1_PITCH_MAX 30
BRD_SD_MISSION 256
